 Security
 .
 If you believe you have found a vulnerability within OAuth2 Proxy or any
 of its dependencies, please do **NOT** open an issue or PR on GitHub,
 please do **NOT** post any details publicly.
 .
 Security disclosures **MUST** be done in private. If you have found an
 issue that you would like to bring to the attention of the maintainers,
 please compose an email and send it to the list of people listed in our
 MAINTAINERS.md (/MAINTAINERS.md) file.
 .
 For more details read our full Security Docs (https://oauth2-
 proxy.github.io/oauth2-proxy/community/security#security-disclosures)
 .
 Security Notice for v6.0.0 and older
 .
 If you are running a version older than v6.0.0 we **strongly recommend**
 to the current version.
 .
 See open redirect vulnerability (https://github.com/oauth2-proxy/oauth2-
 proxy/security/advisories/GHSA-5m6c-jp6f-2vcv) for details.
 .
 Repository History
 .
 **2018-11-27:** This repository was forked from bitly/OAuth2_Proxy
 (https://github.com/bitly/oauth2_proxy). Versions v3.0.0 and up are from
 this fork and will have diverged from any changes in the original fork.
 A list of changes can be seen in the CHANGELOG (/CHANGELOG.md).
 .
 **2020-03-29:** This project was formerly hosted as pusher/oauth2_proxy
 but has been renamed to oauth2-proxy/oauth2-proxy. Going forward, all
 images shall be available at quay.io/oauth2-proxy/oauth2-proxy and
 binaries will be named oauth2-proxy.
